# Dokumentasi Feature — Packaging & Lokasi Wajib (SEMUA Feature)

**Tujuan:** Hindari file dokumentasi bertebaran di root atau tempat random. **SETIAP feature yang sudah dikembang (HCM + SaaS) WAJIB self-contained** dengan dokumentasi di folder khusus `docs/features/<feature>/` dengan struktur yang konsisten.

**Cakupan:** Berlaku untuk:
- ✅ Fitur HCM lama (attendance, payroll, leave, overtime, tickets, performance, goal, training, promotion, resignation, termination, etc)
- ✅ Fitur SaaS baru (subscriptions, packages, domain-management, super-admin-dashboard, purchase-transaction, etc)
- ✅ Fitur auth/identity (identity-auth, user-tenant-management)

## Peraturan Ketat

### 1) Lokasi Dokumentasi Wajib

❌ **DILARANG:**
```
/README.md                            (feature docs di root)
/FEATURE-NAME-DOCS.md                 (docs Feature X di root)
/features/payment/PAYMENT-SETUP.md    (random lokasi)
/backend/docs/...                     (docs di backend folder)
```

✅ **WAJIB:**
```
/docs/features/<feature-name>/
├── README.md                          (overview + navigation)
├── IMPLEMENTATION.md                  (teknis lengkap)
└── [sesuai jenis: E2E-TESTING.md, SETUP.md, SCHEMA.md, API.md, dll]
```

### 2) README.md — WAJIB di Setiap Feature Folder

**Isi minimal:**
```markdown
# Feature Name

## 📚 Documentation Structure

Dokumentasi feature ini terorganisir di folder ini:
- **README.md** (ini) — Overview & navigasi
- **IMPLEMENTATION.md** — Technical docs, architecture, code structure
- **E2E-TESTING.md** (atau sesuai jenis) — Testing guide / Setup / Schema docs

## 🎯 Quick Overview

[Ringkas 2-3 paragraf tentang feature]

## 📊 Feature Statistics

[Tabel: API endpoints, Controllers, Models, etc]

## 📂 Data Model

[Entity relationship & key fields]

## 🚀 Quick Start

[Dev setup / deployment instructions]

## 📞 Documentation Links

| Document | Topic | Audience |
|----------|-------|----------|
| [IMPLEMENTATION.md](IMPLEMENTATION.md) | Technical docs | Developers |
| [OTHER.md](OTHER.md) | ... | ... |

## ✅ Status

[Module version, status, completion date]
```

### 3) Jenis File Dokumentasi Per Feature

**Pilih file yang relevan, HARUS konsisten:**

| File | Kapan Wajib | Isi |
|------|-----------|-----|
| `README.md` | **SELALU** | Overview, navigation, statistics, quick start |
| `IMPLEMENTATION.md` | **SELALU** jika punya backend | Architecture, API endpoints, database schema, file structure, configuration |
| `E2E-TESTING.md` | Jika ada UI/testing | Test scenarios, UAT checklist, debugging tips |
| `SETUP.md` | Jika setup kompleks | Environment, migrations, seeding, first-run steps |
| `API.md` atau `ENDPOINTS.md` | Jika pure API feature | Endpoint reference, request/response examples |
| `SCHEMA.md` | Jika database utama | Detailed schema, relationships, constraints |
| `ARCHITECTURE.md` | Jika arsitektur kompleks | System design, integration points, data flow |

**Rule: Jangan random, gunakan naming konsisten di project.**

### 4) Struktur Folder Standard

```
docs/features/
├── README.md                          (main index)
├── <feature-1>/
│   ├── README.md                      (overview + nav)
│   ├── IMPLEMENTATION.md              (teknis)
│   ├── E2E-TESTING.md                 (testing)
│   └── [SCHEMA.md, SETUP.md, etc]
├── <feature-2>/
│   ├── README.md
│   └── IMPLEMENTATION.md
└── ...
```

### 5) Cleanup Wajib: Root Harus Bersih

**Sebelum menganggap feature selesai:**

1. ✅ Semua docs sudah dipindah ke `docs/features/<feature>/`
2. ✅ File di root (`*.md` yang bukan global) dihapus
3. ✅ README di feature folder punya link ke semua docs
4. ✅ `docs/features/README.md` (main index) ter-update dengan feature baru

**Contoh cleanup:**
```bash
# SALAH: file masih di root
rm -f /ROOT/FEATURE-DOCS.md /ROOT/E2E-TESTING.md

# BENAR: pindah ke folder feature
mv /ROOT/FEATURE-DOCS.md /docs/features/feature-name/IMPLEMENTATION.md
mv /ROOT/E2E-TESTING.md /docs/features/feature-name/E2E-TESTING.md
```

### 6) Main Index — `docs/features/README.md`

File ini WAJIB di-update setiap ada feature baru:

```markdown
# Features Documentation

## Index

| Feature | Status | Links |
|---------|--------|-------|
| [Feature X](feature-x/) | ✅ Complete | [Overview](feature-x/README.md), [Docs](feature-x/IMPLEMENTATION.md), [Testing](feature-x/E2E-TESTING.md) |
| [Feature Y](feature-y/) | ✅ Complete | [Overview](feature-y/README.md), [Docs](feature-y/IMPLEMENTATION.md) |

[alphabetically sorted]
```

### 7) Compliance Audit — Semua Feature (HCM + SaaS) — ENFORCE

**Fitur wajib sudah ada dan HARUS follow rule ini (23 fitur):**

| # | Feature | README | IMPLEMENTATION | Testing | Status | Link |
|----|---------|--------|---|---|---|---|
| 1-23 | attendance, domain, employee-salary, employees-org, goal, identity, leave, overtime, packages, payroll-items, payroll-runs, payroll-components, performance, policies, promotion, resignation, subscriptions, super-admin, termination, tickets, training, purchase-tx, user-tenant | ✅ Ada | ⚠️ Minimal* | ❌▪Mostly | ⚠️ Partial | [Audit Table](../../docs/features/README.md) |

**Legend:**
- ✅ Ada = Semua feature folder punya README.md
- ⚠️ Minimal* = 21/23 features punya basic IMPLEMENTATION.md (incomplete), hanya purchase-transaction lengkap
- ❌ Mostly = Hanya purchase-transaction punya E2E-TESTING.md lengkap
- ⚠️ Partial = Compliance status mixed → **HARUS diperbaiki sebelum release**

**Action items:**
1. ✅ Purchase Transactions → Complete (sudah done)
2. 🔄 HCM Core Features (payroll, attendance, leave, HR) → Lengkapi IMPLEMENTATION.md dengan detail
3. 📋 Optional Features (tickets, training, policies) → Minimal IMPLEMENTATION.md cukup

### 8) Jangan Boleh Bypass — Enforcement Ketat

**Rule ini STRICT dan NON-NEGOTIABLE:**
- ❌ DILARANG commit docs di root (`.md` non-global)
- ❌ DILARANG feature "selesai" tanpa folder di `docs/features/<feature>/`
- ❌ DILARANG skip IMPLEMENTATION.md hanya karena "sudah ada di API docs"
- ❌ DILARANG update feature docs tapi lupa update `docs/features/README.md` main index
- ❌ DILARANG tulis documentation di Backend folder atau random lokasi

**Jika user/dev request bypass:** Tolak dan explain rule ini. Dokumentasi = deliverable, bukan opsional.

### 9) Checklist Sebelum "Feature Selesai"

Agent HARUS bisa jawab YES untuk semua:

- [ ] Feature folder exist di `docs/features/<feature-name>/`?
- [ ] `README.md` exist dengan overview + navigation + quick start?
- [ ] `IMPLEMENTATION.md` exist dengan technical docs lengkap (jika ada backend)?
- [ ] Testing/Setup/Schema docs exist sesuai jenis feature?
- [ ] Semua doc files pindah dari root / random folder?
- [ ] Root directory bersih (tidak ada `<FEATURE-NAME>-DOCS.md` dll)?
- [ ] `docs/features/README.md` ter-update dengan feature di main index?
- [ ] Link antar docs berfungsi (gunakan relative path)?

### 10) Hak Istimewa: Dokumentasi Global vs Feature

**Boleh di root atau docs global:**
```
/docs/architecture/        (big picture system design)
/docs/database/            (global schema reference)
/docs/security/            (security baseline global)
/docs/api/                 (OpenAPI, global API spec)
/docs/planning/            (project planning, roadmap)
/QUICK-REFERENCE.md        (global quick ref)
/README.md                 (project main README)
```

**DILARANG di root (harus di feature folder):**
```
/PAYMENT-SETUP.md          → /docs/features/payments/SETUP.md
/INVOICE-DOCS.md           → /docs/features/invoices/IMPLEMENTATION.md
/PAYROLL-E2E-GUIDE.md      → /docs/features/payroll-runs/E2E-TESTING.md
```

### 11) Tool Usage

**Create folder + file:**
```bash
mkdir -p docs/features/<feature-name>
# Create: README.md, IMPLEMENTATION.md, etc
```

**Move docs:**
```bash
mv /<random-location>/<FILE>.md docs/features/<feature-name>/IMPLEMENTATION.md
```

**Update docs/features/README.md:**
```markdown
| [Feature Name](feature-name/) | ✅ Complete | [README](feature-name/README.md), [Impl](feature-name/IMPLEMENTATION.md), [Testing](feature-name/E2E-TESTING.md) |
```

**Verify links:**
```bash
# Cek file exist
ls -la docs/features/*/README.md
ls -la docs/features/*/IMPLEMENTATION.md
```

### 12) Bagaimana Jika Docs Kecil?

**Tetap wajib 3 file minimum:**
- `README.md` — minimal: overview 1 paragraf + quick start + statistics table
- `IMPLEMENTATION.md` — minimal: architecture diagram + file structure + config
- (Jika ada testing) `E2E-TESTING.md` — minimal: test scenarios dengan step-by-step

**Jangan:** "Kecil aja, satukan di satu file." → Tujuan adalah navigasi mudah & modular, bukan file size.

