## Failure Cases

### ❌ Gagal

```
Feature: Payment Manager
Goal: Create payment feature

❌ FAILS:
- Dev buat 3 controller, migration, service
- Tulis hanya 1 file README.md di root
- Tidak ada file IMPLEMENTATION.md (teknis)
- Cleanup tidak dijalankan → E2E-TESTING.md masih di root
- docs/features/README.md tidak ter-update
```

**Diagnosis:** Agent lupa step packaging & cleanup. Feature "selesai" tapi docs amburadul.

### ✅ Benar

```
Feature: Payment Manager
Goal: Create payment feature

✅ CORRECT:
1. Dev selesai coding
2. Bikin folder: docs/features/payment-manager/
3. Create & push 3 files:
   - README.md (overview + nav)
   - IMPLEMENTATION.md (22 sections + architecture)
   - E2E-TESTING.md (6 scenarios + checklist)
4. Update docs/features/README.md dengan entry baru
5. Confirm: root bersih, links work, checklist 100%
```

